{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04623","headline":"奉和同皇太子过慈恩寺应制二首 二 · 张说","name":"奉和同皇太子过慈恩寺应制二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朗朗神居峻，轩轩瑞象威。\n圣君成愿果，太子拂天衣。\n至乐三灵会，深仁四皓归。\n还闻涡水曲，更绕白云飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}